  "question": {
    "text": "Let a smooth curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be such that the slope of the tangent at any point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> on it is directly proportional to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>. If the curve passes through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "kBrNm",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dgZ7m",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZToZV",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lbW73",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi></math>&nbsp;is proportionality constant)</p><p>Now integrating both side,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mi>y</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>If the above equation satisfy&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now it also passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>ln</mi><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, equation becomes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
